OL,3,CFuneral director who hoarded bodies
OL,4,C'sorry', court told
OL,6,FWarning: Article contains distressing
OL,7,Fdetails
OL,9,FDisgraced funeral director Robert Bush
OL,10,Fhas apologised "without qualification"
OL,11,Ffor the distress caused to bereaved
OL,12,Fvictims.
OL,14,FLawyers for the 48-year-old told a
OL,15,Fcourt he had listened to the "human
OL,16,Fcost of what he has done" as he faces
OL,17,Fsentencing for 67 offences, including
OL,18,Fpreventing a lawful and decent burial,
OL,19,Ffraud and theft.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/10
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
