FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who hoarded bodies
OL,4,C'sorry', court told
OL,6,FThe Legacy Funeral Directors boss was
OL,7,Fdescribed by Richard Wright KC,
OL,8,Fmitigating, as "a pariah", adding that
OL,9,Fhe was "sorry" for his crimes and
OL,10,Foffered an apology "without
OL,11,Fqualification".
OL,13,F"He accepts that responsibility," Mr
OL,14,FWright said.
OL,16,FThirty-five bodies were discovered at
OL,17,Fthe Legacy premises at Hessle Road in
OL,18,FHull in March 2024. Families were
OL,19,Feither given the wrong ashes or were
OL,20,Ftold cremations had been taken care of.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/10
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who hoarded bodies
OL,4,C'sorry', court told
OL,6,FBush also fraudulently sold funeral
OL,7,Fplans and stole charitable donations.
OL,9,FAmong grieving loved ones given the
OL,10,Fwrong ashes were the families of four
OL,11,Funborn babies who had been miscarried.
OL,12,FOne woman, Lucy Ness, was handed adult
OL,13,Fashes and animal remains instead of
OL,14,Fthose of her baby.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/10
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
