FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who hoarded bodies
OL,4,C'sorry', court told
OL,6,FAddressing Hull Crown Court on
OL,7,FWednesday, Mr Wright KC said: "Over
OL,8,Fthe course of the last two-and-a-half
OL,9,Fdays the court, and through the
OL,10,Funprecedented global media coverage,
OL,11,Fthe world, has listened quietly as
OL,12,Fvictim after victim after victim of
OL,13,FRobert Bush has either come forward to
OL,14,Fread their own victim personal
OL,15,Fstatements or has had their statements
OL,16,Fread on their behalf.
OL,26,@oD@_OU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/10
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who hoarded bodies
OL,4,C'sorry', court told
OL,6,F"He has heard witness after witness
OL,7,Fcastigate his character and heard
OL,8,Ftheir entirely understandable anger,
OL,9,Fpain and outrage, all directed at him.
OL,10,FAnd, all rightly directed at him."
OL,12,FThe barrister said his client's
OL,13,Foffending has caused pain, anguish and
OL,14,Fupset "on a scale that it's difficult
OL,15,Fto comprehend."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@bO]vD@GOUwD@OO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/10
