PN,33206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who hoarded bodies
OL,4,C'sorry', court told
OL,6,FEarlier on Wednesday, it was heard how
OL,7,Fthousands of pounds from the business
OL,8,Fwas paid into Bush's personal account,
OL,9,Fwith more than #90,000 spent on
OL,10,Fluxuries such as holidays, home
OL,11,Fimprovements, shopping and restaurant
OL,12,Ftrips and motorcycling over a seven-
OL,13,Fyear period.
OL,15,FMore than #6,000 was spent on three
OL,16,Ftrips to Center Parcs and #7,000 on a
OL,17,Fnew kitchen in 2020, the court heard.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/10
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
