FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who hoarded bodies
OL,4,C'sorry', court told
OL,6,FMr Wright KC said: "There are demands
OL,7,Ffor answers. Where did the money go,
OL,8,Fand what was it spent on? They're all
OL,9,Fgood questions.
OL,11,F"Whether it was greed, incompetence,
OL,12,Fthe passage of time or inability to
OL,13,Fkeep up with failings. I submit that
OL,14,Fall of those are likely to have played
OL,15,Fa part."
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/10
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
