FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who hoarded bodies
OL,4,C'sorry', court told
OL,6,FBush is facing a jail sentence over
OL,7,Fthe catalogue of charges, which span
OL,8,Fover a 12-year period and were
OL,9,Fdescribed by prosecuting barrister
OL,10,FSteven Ball as "sustained" dishonesty
OL,11,Fand an "egregious" breach of trust.
OL,13,FMr Ball on Wednesday recommended a
OL,14,Fsentence of between 20 and 25 years in
OL,15,Fprison, before mitigation can be taken
OL,16,Finto account.
OL,18,FThese, Mr Wright outlined, were mainly
OL,19,FBush's guilty plea, his previous good
OL,20,Fcharacter and his duties of care to
OL,21,Fhis family.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/10
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
