FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who hoarded bodies
OL,4,C'sorry', court told
OL,6,FIn April, Bush pleaded guilty to 30
OL,7,Fcounts of preventing a lawful and
OL,8,Fdecent burial, and theft from the 12
OL,9,Fcharities.
OL,11,FHe had already admitted 30 counts of
OL,12,Ffraud by false representation relating
OL,13,Fto bodies found at the site, and four
OL,14,F"foetus allegations" of fraud, where
OL,15,Fhe presented ashes to women falsely
OL,16,Fsaying that they were "the remains of
OL,17,Ftheir unborn".
OL,26,@vD@AOUvD@TO]xD@WOUyD@MO]
