OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who hoarded bodies
OL,4,C'sorry', court told
OL,6,FBush also pleaded guilty to a further
OL,7,Fcharge of fraud, covering the ashes of
OL,8,F57 people between 2017 and 2024, and
OL,9,Fone of fraudulent trading relating to
OL,10,Ffuneral plans between 2012 and 2024.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G10/10
